**Legend:** <!-- legend -->.

Current matches Latest release; Outdated is an older or different available version. Published means publication completed and therefore appears as `—` in In build, not as a replacement still in progress. Pending waits for a build; Superseded was replaced by a newer release or attempt; Not built has no recorded build. These three states share grey, with alternative text and hover titles identifying them. Cancelled uses a separate mid-grey visible in light and dark themes. `—` means no available package, no replacement in progress, or an unrecorded fact, according to the column. A waiting dependent's Build log may open its prerequisite release run before a child build job exists.
